body='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Stratus 1.6.4 — verified shader changes</title><style>body{font:16px/1.6 system-ui;background:#101820;color:#eaf1f4;max-width:1500px;margin:auto;padding:24px}h1{font-size:36px;line-height:1.2}a{color:#99dbea}p{color:#c9d5dc}.status{background:#20333e;padding:18px;border-left:4px solid #89c8bb}.pending{border-color:#e3bd78}.grid,.pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}figure{margin:0;background:#1b2b35;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}img{width:100%;display:block}figcaption{padding:10px 14px}figcaption p{margin:4px 0}small{color:#8fc8d2;text-transform:uppercase}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:24px 0}td,th{padding:10px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #40525e}button{background:#263e4b;color:#eaf1f4;border:1px solid #587482;border-radius:5px;padding:9px 14px;margin:4px;cursor:pointer}.comparison{margin:30px 0}code{color:#c1dfd8}@media(max-width:800px){.grid,.pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:28px}}</style><h1>Stratus 1.6.4</h1><p>Matte moisture, smoother cloud traversal, and preserved transparent underwater rendering.</p><div class="status"><b>Actual Main shader validation completed.</b><p>768 native compile/link pairs · 122 focused candidate GPU renders · 53 labeled controls · 235 shader assets matched.</p></div><div class="status pending" id="delivery"><b>Foreground FPS remains unverified.</b><p id="launch-state">Final normal reopening is pending manual Mac unlock. The temporary test client saved and quit gracefully.</p></div><p><a href="../Stratus-1.6.4.zip">Installable ZIP</a> · <a href="../Stratus/README.txt">Installation and migration</a> · <a href="../Stratus/VALIDATION.txt">Validation scope</a> · <a href="results.json">Evidence and delivery state</a> · <a href="changes.diff">Source changes</a></p><table><tr><th>Gate</th><th>Result and scope</th></tr><tr><td>Native compilation</td><td>768/768 links, eight variants, three dimensions; compatibility-shim scope</td></tr><tr><td>GPU correctness</td><td>91 material + 10 water resolve + 3 raster + 18 cloud renders; zero failures</td></tr><tr><td>Iris/Main</td><td>Final immutable source and four presets plus vanilla sky loaded; no shader compile failures</td></tr><tr><td>Visual coverage</td><td>Controls, supporting tests and final-source retests are labeled separately below</td></tr><tr><td>Performance</td><td>Unfocused diagnostics rejected; no gameplay FPS or speedup claim</td></tr></table><p>Matched comparisons use the same camera, time, weather and saved options. Cloud/ripple animation phases differ. Main used Minecraft 1.21.11, Iris 1.10.8, Sodium 0.8.14, Apple M1, an 854×480 framebuffer, render distance 12 and simulation distance 8. The written brief is the art reference; no exact match to an unavailable original image is claimed.</p>'''+comparisons+'''<h2>Inspected captures</h2><p><button onclick="filter('all')">All evidence</button><button onclick="filter('final source')">Final source only</button><button onclick="filter('1.6.3 control')">Baseline controls</button></p><div class="grid">'''+cards+'''</div><h2>Known limits</h2><ul>'''+''.join('<li>'+e(s)+'</li>' for s in checks['known_limits'])+'''</ul><p>Rejected empty/misplaced and experimental frames are recorded in results.json and excluded from the passing final-source views. The blue concrete in the waterfall fixture is a deliberately coloured block.</p><script>function filter(stage){document.querySelectorAll('.grid figure').forEach(el=>el.hidden=stage!=='all'&&el.dataset.stage!==stage)}fetch('results.json').then(r=>r.json()).then(r=>{if(r.delivery&&r.delivery.main_reopened_normally)document.getElementById('launch-state').textContent='Main reopened normally with Stratus 1.6.4 selected. The temporary helper and shader aliases were removed.'}).catch(()=>{})</script></html>'''
